# Build output of `npm run build:bis` (vite lib mode).
# Vite copies `public/` verbatim into outDir, so this directory is a full
# duplicate of the payload, the fonts, quarantine.json AND the vendored engine.
# 39 files, 4.1 MB, all reproducible. It was tracked until 2026-09-01 and the
# tracked bundle had already gone a hash stale behind the published one, which
# is the dead-pointer-that-looks-live hazard this project has paid for before.
